       <message name="IDS_GOOGLE_SEARCH_BOX_EMPTY_HINT_SHORT" desc="The text displayed in the fakebox (on the New Tab page) when it is empty, Google is the default search engine, and short hint text is enabled.">
         Search Google
@@ -7488,7 +7488,7 @@ Keep your key file in a safe place. You will need it to create new versions of y
         Search
       </message>
       <message name="IDS_NTP_SEARCH_BOX_PLACEHOLDER_ASK_OR_TYPE" desc="A steady state placeholder text for the NTP searchbox">
-        Ask Google or type a URL
